# Legal compliance

This site is a **private, independent, non-governmental** civic portal for Hardoi/Beniganj (UP). It must never look or claim to be official government.

- Keep **निजी पहल (Private Initiative)** and **कानूनी अस्वीकरण (Legal Disclaimer)** on every page.
- Do not use official government emblems (Ashoka Chakra, state seals, ministry logos).
- External links: `rel="noopener noreferrer"` (and `target="_blank"` when opening a new tab).
- **Zero data liability:** no tracking, cookies, analytics, or sending form/user data to any server. Client-side only (Jansunwai drafter stays local).
- Do not invent official scheme amounts, eligibility, or legal procedure as if they were certified; keep informational tone and disclaimers.
